.TH DISKTUNE 1M UniSoft
.SH NAME
disktune - tune floppy disk settling time parameters
.SH SYNOPSIS
disktune [\-srt #] [\-hlt #] [\-hut #] device
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I Disktune
tunes floppy disk settling time parameters.
These include
the motor stepping rate
and the rate at which the head loads and unloads.
.I Disktune
thus enables you to obtain the most efficient operation
from your floppy on those systems that support it.
.PP
If no settable parameters are given,
.I disktune
will report the current settings on
.I device.
.I Disktune
retains the current settings on parameters which are not specified.
.PP
The raw device, 
.BR /dev/rflop , 
must be specified.
.PP
The settable parameters are:
.TP 9
.B \-srt #
seek motor stepping rate time in milliseconds 
.TP 9
.B \-hlt #
head loading time in milliseconds 
.TP 9
.B \-hut #
head unload time in milliseconds 
.SH EXAMPLE
.IP
disktune -srt 3 /dev/rfdc0
.PP
will set the step rate time on the floppy controller to
3 ms per step.
.\"	@(#)disktune.5	5.1 of 11/1/83
